            "Lwmloumei nunc mik khou;",
            "Tingpuk lev kandih ’maan kan the,",
            "Lairikzy kazih kumc.",
            "",
            "2 Ravguangc bamv tingkauh luan ’thumhmei,",
            "’Thanmei tingkauh thangc @<4",
            "Jirusalem Thanh 4^& key the,",
            "Chingkhiuhmei karuhna.",
            "",
            "3 Hymdaihmei Racguangc mei nunc lev",
            "Bam ’chamc khang key pw the;",
            "Kazauzian hei meic nunc khang e,",
            "Zianthaymei Racguangc hei.",
            "",
            "4 Mikdui kaguay thutphuilou ni,",
            "Zianmei Kabaanc 4^& @<4;",
            "Sucnumei, ryanramei, pingmei,",
